{
    "title": "Screw Frenzy: ASMR Home",
    "description": "Screw Frenzy is an innovative casual game! A game that combines matching, collecting, and building together. This game is fast-paced, entertaining, and challenging!\r\n\r\nHow to play the game?\r\nIn the game, players observe the color of the toolbox and the position of the screws on the glass, unscrew the screws on the glass, and put the screws into the corresponding toolbox until all the screws are collected. Of course, each level has extra spaces for screws. Please note that if you don't have space to store screws, the level will fail! If you win the level, you can get stars and use them to renovate the room decoration.\r\n\r\nGame features:\r\n1. Novel Collection Mode: Each level has different collection goals, and players need to collect the correct screws into the toolbox. Clear the glass by collecting all the screws so that you can collect other glasses's screws, which tests the player's eyesight and quick reaction.\r\n2. Diverse Level Designs: From ordinary screws to star-shaped screws, from collecting single screws to moving two screws together at the same time, and so on. The levels range from simple to complex. When you unscrew the screws and release the glass, you can relax and release the pressure instantly.\r\n3. Efficient Prop Assistance: As the game progresses, players can unlock a variety of props, such as props for increasing holes, hammer props for breaking glass, and props for increasing toolboxes. These props can help you turn the tide at critical moments.\r\n4. Diverse and interesting activities make your game full of randomness and constantly stimulate your interest and enthusiasm!\r\n\r\nScrew Frenzy brings a brand new gaming experience with its unique and challenging gameplay. Download it now!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Screw Frenzy is an innovative casual game! A game that combines matching, collecting, and building together. This game is fast-paced, entertaining, and challenging!<br><br>How to play the game?<br>In the game, players observe the color of the toolbox and the position of the screws on the glass, unscrew the screws on the glass, and put the screws into the corresponding toolbox until all the screws are collected. Of course, each level has extra spaces for screws. Please note that if you don&#39;t have space to store screws, the level will fail! If you win the level, you can get stars and use them to renovate the room decoration.<br><br>Game features:<br>1. Novel Collection Mode: Each level has different collection goals, and players need to collect the correct screws into the toolbox. Clear the glass by collecting all the screws so that you can collect other glasses&#39;s screws, which tests the player&#39;s eyesight and quick reaction.<br>2. Diverse Level Designs: From ordinary screws to star-shaped screws, from collecting single screws to moving two screws together at the same time, and so on. The levels range from simple to complex. When you unscrew the screws and release the glass, you can relax and release the pressure instantly.<br>3. Efficient Prop Assistance: As the game progresses, players can unlock a variety of props, such as props for increasing holes, hammer props for breaking glass, and props for increasing toolboxes. These props can help you turn the tide at critical moments.<br>4. Diverse and interesting activities make your game full of randomness and constantly stimulate your interest and enthusiasm!<br><br>Screw Frenzy brings a brand new gaming experience with its unique and challenging gameplay. Download it now!",
    "summary": "Enjoy ASMR Nuts And Bolts Matching, start house decorating and designing!",
